{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0154_1000_p", "source_sha256": "261385279792cf9841a6492a0ad62f39c28a904d25d0b0e6d9255813f8549c6f", "ja": "お疲れさま、ジュリア。\n新しい衣装はどうだ？　何かあれば言ってくれ。", "zh": "辛苦了，茱莉亚。\n新衣服感觉怎么样？有什么事就告诉我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0154_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "99c9ebb655d775fc842bcd2f40510cc87c3f54d3f4bc7d28e49f705eefdfa7ca", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れ。\n衣装か……どう言えばいいのか、悩むな……。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n新服装啊……该怎么说呢，有点苦恼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0154_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5a08447a77c6ab25d5c182d8003db73ea52038ca18e63241bdacda4ac2dd7e85", "ja": "えっ？　もしかして、気に入らなかったか？", "zh": "咦？难道是不喜欢吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0154_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "4cb678401e9e276974785eac54dffb8b51a55f27f7202c8fa7981e3d91a0f00e", "ja": "いや、そうじゃないよ。衣装は気に入ってるんだけど、\n鏡を見ると、ちょっと戸惑うっていうか……。", "zh": "不是，不是那样。虽然我很喜欢这套服装，但一照镜子，就觉得有点不知所措……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0154_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "b09879d312f5fad45df96a590ca9c091af0280b7479e5b942f890a04b9ea4dba", "ja": "なんていうか、すごく大人っぽい衣装だろ？\nあたしが、あたしじゃないみたいでさ。", "zh": "该怎么说呢，这身服装特别成熟吧？\n感觉我都不像我自己了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0154_1005_p", "source_sha256": "fad3d5318813c1f737ea55ff30ded163e5a47f504d605b5e75ac3dbefb15509b", "ja": "うん、確かに大人っぽい衣装だな。\nでもジュリアに、よく似合ってると思うよ。", "zh": "嗯，确实是很成熟的服装呢。\n不过我觉得很适合茱莉亚哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0154_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "75fdc8af98f37a4eaa68efd38a4684b23983f82d7817b3cd51387fb74a010a0a", "ja": "それ、本当かよ？　あんたはいつでも、\nなんでもほめるから、信用できないっていうか……。", "zh": "这是真的吗？你总是什么都夸，让人实在没法相信你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0154_1007_p", "source_sha256": "aed8bd672624160722b427a545c9dece51ad856d068f979b8e238523235cacc0", "ja": "そんな事ないって。\n心配なら、みんなにも聞いてみるか？", "zh": "没那回事啦。要是不放心，要不要也去问问大家？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0154_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "91473c237f67150f877bc4b3335d86e3192b29db27871e6b01a7174067394965", "ja": "いや、いい！　……それじゃ、ついでに\n意見を聞かせてほしいんだけど。", "zh": "不用了，没事的！……那正好，顺便\n想听听你的意见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0154_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "3f0f1ea17a0e75a0d1f21cd43f116b738876a19ece41a9f5079e6b9c587ebc80", "ja": "こういう衣装を着てる時って、どうしたらいいんだ？\nその、立ち居振る舞いっていうか……。", "zh": "穿着这种服装的时候，该怎么做才好？\n就是，举止什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0154_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "eba7fc3b673b5a390929f450b9f8f5318251f12f1485bbbed772ea7591482417", "ja": "すごく、大人っぽい衣装だからさ。\nすこしは合わせないと、と思って……。", "zh": "毕竟是很成熟的服装嘛。  \n我想，至少也得稍微配合一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0154_1011_p", "source_sha256": "f4238b7dd38345521dafd84a7259e6a2f9ea8628212b9330a47459652861481f", "ja": "そうだなぁ……でも、今のままでも十分だし、\n無理に変えなくてもいいと思うけど。", "zh": "是这样啊……不过，现在这样就已经足够了，\n我觉得也不用勉强自己改变。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0154_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "3fabd190cd0487a30561799e293a7700bbcf1b7eafb0d43a97de421612d025fb", "ja": "な、なんだよ……。やっぱり、あたしには\n似合わないってか？　大人っぽいとか……。", "zh": "难、难道说……果然还是觉得不适合我吗？什么成熟风之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0154_1013_p", "source_sha256": "7c85223ab6da8ba5ed8a7a25f0a960e3b7d1c30090343c241c8adf8e08d58d53", "ja": "そうじゃなくて。どんな衣装でも、無理しなくても、\nジュリアの魅力に変わりはないって事だよ。", "zh": "不是那样。不管穿什么服装，就算不勉强自己，茱莉亚的魅力也不会改变。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0154_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "6942e88501dce78627a9097db63b66c16b05f8e493cd4fc60ed5760f5acac34f", "ja": "{$P$}……ははっ。\nOK、あんたの言いたいことはわかったよ。", "zh": "{$P$}……哈哈。\n好吧，我明白你想说什么了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0154_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "b1e048b66787fa45e2f64a4dacd0e68e5f1e34b8acfd4e106a886e6c8cbb1863", "ja": "たしかに、大人っぽい衣装を着たからって、\n今すぐ大人になれるわけじゃないもんな。", "zh": "确实，不是穿上成熟一点的服装，就能马上变成大人嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0154_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "5600225d8ff6149e76ecbe0229e530067dfe4fa33f6e380bc59ae648a232bcc0", "ja": "ちょっと、浮かれてたかな。あたしも、\nこういうところがまだまだ子どもだってことか……。", "zh": "我是不是有点得意忘形了啊。看来我在这种地方还是个孩子呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0154_1017_p", "source_sha256": "e38a37877235de788580146338fb50de93c36c43cd16edc5e649e3ba4a860d6c", "ja": "はは。浮かれるほど喜んでくれたのなら、\n衣装を用意した方としては嬉しいけどな。", "zh": "哈哈。你能开心到这种程度，作为准备服装的人，我也很高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0154_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "a8aa42bf67c1486ad7cfc4c5bd802a6c69fe85aa566de8dc3c4760c2d3aba851", "ja": "ったく……あんたには敵わないな、\n{$P$}。", "zh": "真是的……我真拿你没办法，  \n{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_050jul0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_050jul0154_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "d6c5ad1f00e8fbb987191ed4d52bb8d3a63732122dc92ae523a8a0e5c65ed4a1", "ja": "ステージに立つときは、自然で大人っぽい\nあたしを見せてやるからな。覚悟しろよ♪", "zh": "站上舞台时，我会让你看看自然又成熟的我。做好心理准备吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
